  "details": "Version:\nVRChat 2020.2.3p1, build 946\nDescription of the bug:\nWhen using Gesture Overrides on PC, the gestures do not show up on the Quest version of the Avatar, despite both avatars being set up identically (including Mesh Names, Blend Shape Names, Armature and Bone Names, etc.)\nSteps to reproduce:\nSpecifically, I was playing on Desktop Mode, standing in front of a Quest user, and using multiple Blend Shape gesture overrides (changing between them every now and then). I could see the standard gestures from the Quest user (since their avatar had no overrides), however they could not see any Custom Gestures from me.",
